SUMMARY:ZADO performs folk songs of life and love at Performers’ Circle
DESCRIPTION:ZADO is a Sacramento-based vocal ensemble performing international folk songs\, particularly those from Eastern Europe. They share these beautiful and unique songs and dances with the hope of inspiring listeners to treasure their own heritage\, cultures and traditions as well as those of others. ZADO will be accompanied by Jim Shoemaker on accordion. Open mic 7-8:15 followed by the featured performance.
